& [Requirements]
  + [SAC5B-001] require the exact published Slice5A manifest evidence verifier and git identity
  + [SAC5B-002] build locked offline optimized in local Ubuntu 24.04 WSL with one build job and no remote host
  + [SAC5B-003] execute one warmup then exactly seven serialized measured generator trials
  + [SAC5B-004] GNU time owns elapsed seconds and maximum resident KiB observations for only the generator process
  + [SAC5B-005] convert to elapsed milliseconds and peak resident bytes without relabeling RSS as allocations
  + [SAC5B-006] require every generated report to equal the checked Slice5A evidence byte-for-byte
  + [SAC5B-007] emit strict JSON with command environment artifact hashes ordered trials and deterministic aggregate calculation
  + [SAC5B-008] rerun verification checks identities trial cardinality ordering aggregates and report equality without rerunning timing
  + [SAC5B-009] no product provider training effect persistence remote FPGA or Minecraft modification

& [Acceptance]
  + positive live seven-trial local measurement and independent artifact verification pass
  + missing changed malformed partial or mismatched inputs refuse
  + PowerShell parse format evidence and attribution gates pass before publication

